SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This grant covers the work authored in this repository since the fork point
(commit 2a941e7 onward, 2026-07-14). It does not and cannot extend to:

1. Inherited code. This repository is a fork of iamnolanhu/claude-dotfiles,
   which publishes no license. Portions carried over from upstream — parts of
   setup.sh, the profile/CLAUDE.md assembly system, and several skills under
   skills/ — remain under the upstream author's terms, which are currently
   unstated. Reuse of those portions should be cleared with the upstream
   author.

2. Vendored third-party skills. Skills copied from other projects retain
   their original licenses. See NOTICE.md for the inventory.

3. Third-party software this repository installs or configures (firstmate,
   herdr, 9router, and the agent CLIs). Those carry their own licenses and
   are not redistributed here.
